OL,3,GNEWSAFamily desperately seeking answers
OL,4,Aover uncle's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a Worcestershire man
OL,7,Fwhose death was investigated as murder
OL,8,Fsay they are still "desperately seeking
OL,9,Fanswers" after prosecutors advised that
OL,10,Fno further action should be taken in
OL,11,Fthe case.
OL,13,FPaul Hart, 52, died after being injured
OL,14,Fduring an altercation in Malvern in
OL,15,FJuly 2025.
OL,17,FThree men were arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fmurder, but West Mercia Police said a
OL,19,Ffile of evidence was passed to the
OL,20,FCrown Prosecution Service (CPS), which
OL,21,Fadvised that no charges would be
OL,22,Fbrought.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
